## Usage

### Eight Semantic States

One $5 \times 5$ halftone checkerboard warped through a spherical lens expresses eight AI reasoning and execution phases, smoothly morphing in place whenever `state` changes.

::::TuffDemoWrapper{demo="MatrixLoaderStatesDemo" code-lang="vue"}
---
code: |
  <template>
    <TxMatrixLoader state="thinking" size="md" />
    <TxMatrixLoader state="searching" size="md" show-label />
    <TxMatrixLoader state="extracting" size="lg" />
    <TxMatrixLoader state="defining" size="lg" />
  </template>
---
::::

### Display Eras

Switch `era` across five electronic display aesthetics and combine with `shape` (`quad`, `circle`, `diamond`). The default `oled` era keeps a transparent background and adapts its ink to light and dark themes; the other eras render a framed micro-screen with scanlines, phosphor glow, or Bayer dithering.

::::TuffDemoWrapper{demo="MatrixLoaderErasDemo" code-lang="vue"}
---
code: |
