### Best Practices

- Keep a single mounted instance and update `state` as an AI run progresses (`thinking` → `searching` → `generating`) so transitions cross-morph cleanly.
- Prefer the default `era="oled"` with `size="xs"` or `size="sm"` inline beside text so the transparent canvas blends with any surface.
- Pass an explicit `time` (in seconds) for deterministic visual regression tests or frame capture; this bypasses `requestAnimationFrame`.
- Supply localized copy via `labels` or `label` on non-English surfaces; add `aria-hidden="true"` when adjacent text already announces the status.

## API Reference

### Props

| Name | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `state` | `MatrixLoaderState` | `'thinking'` | Semantic motion field across 8 AI phases. |
| `size` | `'xs' \| 'sm' \| 'md' \| 'lg'` | `'md'` | Standard size tier (18 / 24 / 40 / 64px). |
| `displaySize` | `number` | — | Explicit CSS pixel size; overrides `size`. |
| `era` | `MatrixLoaderEra` | `'oled'` | Display era: `oled`, `crt`, `vfd`, `dither`, `lcd`. |
| `shape` | `MatrixLoaderShape` | `'quad'` | Primitive per tile: `quad`, `circle`, `diamond`. |
| `gridSize` | `number` | `5` | Odd grid order (3, 5, 7, 9). |
| `bulge` | `number` | `1` | Spherical curvature (`0` = flat plane, `1` = full sphere). |
| `taper` | `number` | `1` | Left-to-right halftone size gradient (`0` = uniform). |
| `fill` | `number` | `1` | Tile fill ratio relative to cell pitch (`0.45`–`1.25`). |
| `speed` | `number` | `1` | Positive playback speed multiplier. |
| `intensity` | `number` | `1` | Motion amplitude (`0` holds the rest composition). |
| `noise` | `number` | `0` | 2D gradient noise drift strength (`0`–`1`). |
| `noiseFrequency` | `number` | `1.4` | Spatial frequency of the 2D noise field. |
| `fxStrength` | `number` | `0.65` | Scanline, glow, or quantization strength for non-OLED eras (`0`–`1`). |
| `theme` | `'auto' \| 'dark' \| 'light'` | `'auto'` | Color theme; `auto` tracks the document theme. |
| `color` | `string` | — | Custom CSS ink color for the `oled` era. |
| `transitionDuration` | `number` | `220` | Cross-morph duration in ms when `state` changes. |
| `paused` | `boolean` | `false` | Pauses the loop while keeping the current frame painted. |
| `time` | `number` | — | Deterministic timestamp in seconds; skips rAF when finite. |
| `label` | `string` | `labels[state]` | Explicit status label; takes precedence over `labels`. |
| `labels` | `MatrixLoaderLabels` | English defaults | Localized per-state label map. |
| `showLabel` | `boolean` | `false` | Displays the status label visually below the canvas. |

