### Exposed Methods

| Name | Signature | Description |
|------|-----------|-------------|
| `renderFrame` | `(explicitSec?: number) => void` | Imperatively paints a single frame at the given timestamp in seconds. |

## Overview

- Mounted instances share `performance.now()`, keeping multiple loaders on screen in phase.
- Playback pauses automatically when scrolled offscreen (`IntersectionObserver`) or when the tab is hidden (`visibilitychange`).
- Under `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce`, the loop stops and paints one representative static frame that still follows theme and prop updates.
- The canvas scales with `devicePixelRatio` capped at 2; canvas-less environments (SSR, jsdom) keep the semantic wrapper and skip drawing safely.
- The root exposes `role="status"` and `aria-live="polite"`; when `showLabel` is `false`, the label remains in the accessibility tree via the clip pattern.

## Technologies

- Dependency-free Canvas 2D mathematical engine combining a tapered halftone grid, 2D spherical lens warp, analytic state fields, 2D gradient noise, and 4×4 Bayer ordered dithering.
- Source: `packages/tuffex/packages/components/src/matrix-loader/`.

